sequenceDiagram
    participant App as S-RAT<br/>Pipeline
    participant Azure as Azure Text Analytics<br/>(local instance)
    participant UMLS as UMLS<br/>Terminology Service
    participant SNOMED as SNOMED CT<br/>Server (local)
    participant Fallback as Fallback<br/>Translation List
    participant LLM as Open-Source<br/>Language Model (local)

    App->>Azure: Extract clinical entities
    Azure-->>App: Medical concepts with UMLS CUIs

    loop For each extracted concept
        App->>App: Check if SNOMED CT ID available
        alt No SNOMED CT ID
            App->>UMLS: Retrieve SNOMED CT mapping
            UMLS-->>App: SNOMED CT ID
        end
        App->>SNOMED: Retrieve translated term
        alt No translation available
            App->>Fallback: Use human-verified translation
            Fallback-->>App: Localized term
        else Translation found
            SNOMED-->>App: Localized term
        end
    end

    App->>LLM: Construct prompt with localized terms<br/>and translate full report
    LLM-->>App: Final translated report
